      },
      "text": "\n\nPanama lets you see the Pacific Ocean and the Caribbean Sea on a single trip. The itinerary includes city tours, historic forts, national parks, time at the beach, jungle, a canopy tour, a coffee plantation and islands. The more active part of the trip includes a four-wheel-drive ascent of Barú Volcano, drives along mountain roads and transfers by boat.\n"
